The '''Dwarven Base Camp''' is a sub-area in {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}, from there people can go to {{zone|Fossil Research Center}} or the {{zone|Glacite Tunnels}}. It requires {{Coll|Heart of the Mountain 7}} to access.

{{ZoneText|Talk to Dr Stone.|Talk to Pilnius.|Talk to Sor'Hen.|Enter the Glacite Tunnels.}}

== Entry Requirement ==
After reaching {{Coll|Heart of the Mountain 7}}, the [[player]] needs to talk with {{NPCSprite|Gwendolyn}} who instructs the player to find {{NPCSprite|Dulin}} in the {{Zone|Hanging Court}} who instructs the player to forge a {{Item|Secret Railroad Pass}} and give it to a {{NPCSprite|Ticket Master}} or {{NPCSprite|Station Master}}, which then allows the player to use the minecart to the '''Dwarven Base Camp'''.

== Purpose ==
Here the player may interact with several NPCs, including {{NPCSprite|Dr. Stone}} who is located in the {{Zone|Fossil Research Center}}. Dr. Stone will ask for [[Fossils]] in return for [[Heart of the Mountain|HOTM]] exp, {{SBXP}}, {{Skill|Mining|XP}}, {{Glacite Powder}}, and even new [[The Forge|forge recipes]] for [[Pets]]. The [[Fossil Excavator]] is also located in this area.

The campfire located in the {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}} reduces players' {{Stat|cold}}: {{Stat|cold}} is a Stat that accumulates while mining in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} and {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}, which hinders movement speed and {{Stat|ms}}.

